   "date": "2016-11-22T15:08:12Z",
   "subject": "Capture a user ID in a secure shinyapps application",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Can I capture a user ID in a shinyapps implementation that&#39;s requiring Authentication?<p>I want to be able to use the ID to filter a user&#39;s access to a dataset in my application.</p>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "OeAz5mM5BwAJ",
   "from": "Joseph Mienko",
   "author": "cd3acd6a194a56a6",
   "date": "2016-11-22T16:05:11Z",
   "subject": "Re: Capture a user ID in a secure shinyapps application",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Intuitively, I think I would like to see an additional component of the &quot;session&quot; object that could be accessed via session$user. <div><br></div><div>The value would be NA for all shiny apps running outside of <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361465023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LemIfq2qRW5bjuwFfBc-9\">shinyapps.io</a> and for all <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361465023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LemIfq2qRW5bjuwFfBc-9\">shinyapps.io</a> &quot;Public&quot; applications. </div><div><br></div><div>For <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361465023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LemIfq2qRW5bjuwFfBc-9\">shinyapps.io</a> &quot;Private&quot; applications, the object would be populations with the userid (i.e. email address) of the authenticated application user. </div><div><br></div><div>Is there something that gets me close to this within the existing shiny/<a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361465023000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LemIfq2qRW5bjuwFfBc-9\">shinyapps.io</a> framework or should this be a feature request?</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><br>On Tuesday, November 22, 2016 at 7:08:12 AM UTC-8, Joseph Mienko wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Can I capture a user ID in a shinyapps implementation that&#39;s requiring Authentication?<p>I want to be able to use the ID to filter a user&#39;s access to a dataset in my application.</p></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
