     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Joseph,<div><br></div><div>Good news, <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361465024000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HoFu3TmMbwMifNc1C5rST\">shinyapps.io</a> works exactly as you expect. session$user is defined as the authenticated user&#39;s email address when he or she visits your private application. </div><div><br></div><div>Hope that helps,</div><div>-Andy</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
