    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks to you and @andy for these replies!<div><br></div><div>It might be advisable to update the session object documentation at <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/session.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/session.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361465025000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1l16QMygo-mWbQESKWSJvF\">http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/session.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>Even if user isn&#39;t in the CRAN version of the session object, it seems like this would be good information for <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361465026000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UtN7KaweP-UN8kUpp1BXA\">shinyapps.io</a> users/customers to have this information. </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks again!</div><div><br></div><div>-Joe</div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
