     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">We had hoped it would be discoverable in the user doc <a href=\"http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/metrics.html#tracking-user-and-session-information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/metrics.html%23tracking-user-and-session-information&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361465027000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31jM0B3ur2SuXc-W4uOvev\">here</a> but perhaps we need to do something more. <div>Getting information out is harder than we were hoping it would be, if you have some suggestions for us, we would really appreciate it.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Tareef</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Nov 22, 2016 at 1:39 PM, Joseph A. Mienko <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mien...@uw.edu</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
